  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco's Campaign Hat, aka the drill sergeant hat, is crafted from sturdy brown felt, embodying its iconic look and heritage. The wide brimmed military hat is made of 100% brown wool felt in a traditional 4-dent style, with a 6.5 inch height and a 3-inch wide stiff brim that helps shield your eyes from the sun. The round brown hat features an adjustable chinstrap with a metal buckle and 2 rivets at the brim for secure fastening. The 4 incorporated air vents provide additional airflow and circulation.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "2163",
  "description": "<p>Rothco's Campaign Hat, aka the drill sergeant hat, is crafted from sturdy brown felt, embodying its iconic look and heritage. The wide brimmed military hat is made of 100% brown wool felt in a traditional 4-dent style, with a 6.5 inch height and a 3-inch wide stiff brim that helps shield your eyes from the sun. The round brown hat features an adjustable chinstrap with a metal buckle and 2 rivets at the brim for secure fastening. The 4 incorporated air vents provide additional airflow and circulation. A brown ribbon adorns the outside crown of the hat, while the inner band is black with 'Campaign' in gold and a small black bow, adding a touch of elegance to its military design. Keep your head in the game with Rothco&rsquo;s collection of headwear and accessories. Designed with precision and purpose, our headgear is built to withstand the harshest conditions. Whether you&rsquo;re tackling the cold in one of our Watch Caps or Balaclavas, or out on a mission in a Boonie Hat or Fatigue Cap, our diverse range of headwear provides unmatched comfort and protection for everyone from active-duty personnel to outdoor enthusiasts.</p>",
